            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La ngamakhosi elizwe anqotshwa ngabakoIsrayeli, bathatha ilizwe lawo ngaphetsheya kweJordani ngasempumalanga, kusukela esihotsheni saseArinoni kusiya entabeni yaseHermoni, lalo lonke iAraba kusiya ngasempumalanga;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 21:21–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Dute 2:26—3:11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uSihoni inkosi yamaAmori owayehlala eHeshiboni, ebusa kusukela eAroweri elisemphethweni wesihotsha saseArinoni laphakathi kwesihotsha, lengxenye yeGileyadi kuze kufike emfuleni iJaboki ongumngcele wamaAmoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leAraba kuze kufike olwandle lwaseKinerethi, kusiya empumalanga lasekuyeni eBeti‐Jeshimothi kuze kube solwandle lwaseAraba, uLwandle lweTshwayi, kusiya eningizimu emawatheni ePisiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loOgi inkosi yaseBashani omunye wabasalayo kumaRefa owayehlala eAshitarothi laseEdreyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wabusa intaba yaseHermoni leSaleka lalo lonke iBashani kuze kube semngceleni wamaGeshuri lamaMahakathi, lengxenye yeGileyadi kuze kufike emngceleni kaSihoni inkosi yaseHeshiboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose inceku yeNkosi labakoIsrayeli babanqoba. UMose walinika ilizwe labo abakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
